  "description": "WUWSIT crystallizes in the cubic crystal system with space group P 21 3. Reported CIF formula moiety: C75 H72 Dy3 N9 O20 Zn3 4+,2(Cl1 O4 1-),2(H1 O1 1-),8(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Zn1 (Zn) has 3 O neighbors; Dy1F (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Zn1F (Zn) has 3 O neighbors; Dy1I (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Zn1I (Zn) has 3 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.482-3.851 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 102.23-110.03°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Zn3Dy3(O2)L3(PyCO2)3](OH)2(ClO4)2·8H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
